{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightAddCell","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.OcneanuWeightAddCell","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HookLengthAddCell"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuDenProd_addCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuDenProd_addCell","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightAddCell.lean#L73-L86","doc":"**The denominator does not.**  The added cell contributes `q² − 1` (its hook is `1`), and every\nold cell's factor moves by one step exactly when it shares the new cell's row or column. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuNumProd_addCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuNumProd_addCell","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightAddCell.lean#L62-L71","doc":"**The numerator gains exactly one factor.**  Each factor depends only on its own cell, so\nadding a cell is `Finset.prod_insert` and nothing more. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_eq_numProd_div_denProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_eq_numProd_div_denProd","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightAddCell.lean#L59-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuDenProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuDenProd","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightAddCell.lean#L55-L57","doc":"The denominator of `ocneanuWeight`, as its own object. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuNumProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuNumProd","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightAddCell.lean#L51-L53","doc":"The numerator of `ocneanuWeight`, as its own object. ","signatureChunk":0}]}